sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant NX as Nexus ∞
  participant L2 as LiveKit / SIP Layer
  participant AMD as AMD
  participant C as Cortex ∞ / Pipecat
  participant PD as Pro Desk Associate
  participant VM as Voicemail

  NX->>L2: Start outbound call
